# =============================================================================
# Shipping - Storefront Shipping Calculate API Smoke Tests
# =============================================================================

### Calculate shipping – no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/calculate
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "{{nonExistentId}}",
  "shippingMethodId": "{{nonExistentId}}"
}

### Calculate shipping – success (200) with auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/storefront/shipping/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{storeToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "orderId": "{{nonExistentId}}",
  "shippingMethodId": "{{nonExistentId}}"
}
